      <para> What is the \(y\)-coordinate of the vertex? </para>
      <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para> Correct! The \(y\)-coordinate of the vertex of this equation is 8.</para>
    </solution>
        </exercise>
  <!--END QUESTION.-->
  <!--Q4c-->
  <exercise data-content-id="798d9134-c715-4e30-8eda-95ddc060c136" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-solution="Up" data-solution-options="[&quot;Up&quot;, &quot;Down&quot;]">
