      <para> What is the \(y\)-coordinate of the vertex?</para>
      <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! The \(y\)-coordinate of the vertex of this equation is 8.</para>
    </solution>
        </exercise>
  <!--END QUESTION.-->
  <!--Q5c-->
  <exercise data-content-id="82feb2b3-eeb0-4f87-a8d9-d9ec880ba7e9" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-solution="Down" data-solution-options="[&quot;Up&quot;, &quot;Down&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> Does the graph open up or down?</para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! The graph opens downward. The squared term has a negative coefficient (-1).</para>
    </solution>
    </exercise>
  <!--END QUESTION.-->
